# pnkg is a SEPARATE, sibling repo (its own .git — see its own remote for
# the real history), not part of this one. It ended up here as an
# unintended git submodule reference (no .gitmodules ever existed, so it
# wasn't even a properly configured submodule) — see README.md/CODEBASE_GUIDE.md
# for how this app relates to it. Keep it out of this repo entirely.
/pnkg/

# 735MB+ RDF dump — nowhere near GitHub's 100MB hard file limit, and not
# something this frontend app reads directly (it queries Fuseki over
# SPARQL, see CODEBASE_GUIDE.md §1). Reference material, not source —
# keep it local, don't track it.
/pnkg20260709.ttl
